   "section": "engine/engine/dialogs/SteamOptions.lua",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "Enable Steam Cloud saves.\nYour saves will be put on steam cloud and always be available everywhere.\nDisable if you have bandwidth limitations.#WHITE#",
   "target": "启用 Steam 云存档。\n你的存档将保存在 Steam 云端，随时随地皆可使用。\n如果你的网络带宽有限，请禁用此选项。#WHITE#",
   "source_file": "game/engines/default/engine/engine/dialogs/SteamOptions.lua @ 624a67329fe2 (pinned core)",
   "source_lines": []
  },
  {
   "id": "64fcf9e4dfaa",
   "unit_id": "64fcf9e4dfaa8260050ec7948c7b595d22f41628514a941a3431a1c46d94795f",
   "revision_key": "1cb368c5ad8ed4fd913a9d20e9d31c3df3b81d86470305921169ddd49a302037",
   "translation_file": "engine.lua",
   "translation_line": 943,
   "section": "engine/engine/dialogs/VideoOptions.lua",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "Request this display refresh rate.\nSet it lower to reduce CPU load, higher to increase interface responsiveness.#WHITE#",
   "target": "设置游戏的目标帧率。\n降低帧率可以减轻 CPU 负载，提高帧率可以提升界面响应速度。#WHITE#",
   "source_file": "game/engines/default/engine/engine/dialogs/VideoOptions.lua @ 624a67329fe2 (pinned core)",
   "source_lines": []
  },
  {
   "id": "be997ada3aea",
   "unit_id": "be997ada3aeac0314015fb0e1c0594c3e0cd84a7b621357f6dd4a14f0b3b54cd",
   "revision_key": "93babdc8a241681471d1dee0df7a65f298536baac614b9b808606f6ad9207533",
   "translation_file": "engine.lua",
   "translation_line": 949,
   "section": "engine/engine/dialogs/VideoOptions.lua",
   "source_tag": "_t",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "Controls the particle effects density.\nThis option allows to change the density of the many particle effects in the game.\nIf the game is slow when displaying spell effects try to lower this setting.#WHITE#",
   "target": "设定粒子效果的密度。\n这一选项可以调整游戏内的各类粒子效果密度。\n如果在显示法术特效时游戏运行变慢，请尝试调低此设置。#WHITE#",
   "source_file": "game/engines/default/engine/engine/dialogs/VideoOptions.lua @ 624a67329fe2 (pinned core)",
   "source_lines": []
  },
  {
   "id": "1bcda199fa7d",
   "unit_id": "1bcda199fa7d7f1f2752c62a81a0b3e927d4f39a1038f8edacc55884bc0092d9",
